cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Whoop Loop: personal AI health analyst on top of WHOOP"
abstract: >-
  Personal health analyst over the WHOOP API: early illness warnings from
  deviations against personal baselines (rules after Alavi 2022, Miller 2020,
  Mason 2022), a self-calibrating energy balance, a Telegram bot and an MCP
  server for Claude. Thresholds and the alert combination are the author's
  choice and have not been clinically validated.
authors:
  - given-names: Alibek
    family-names: Omertaev
repository-code: "https://github.com/omertaevalibekai/whoop-loop"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/whoop-loop/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - whoop
  - wearables
  - illness detection
  - heart rate variability
  - mcp
  - claude
